# What must never reach the public site.
#
# .gitignore protects the REPO. It does not protect a `vercel --prod`
# deploy, which uploads the working directory — ignored files included.
# Every path below is present on disk, git-ignored, and was one CLI deploy
# away from being served at vertexlabsolutions.com. Checked 2026-11-22:
# none of it is live. Keep it that way.

# Credentials. The reason this file exists.
.credentials.env
*.env

# Operational reports — the same list as .gitignore, for the same reason.
marketing-reports
health-reports
revenue-reports
build-reports
ceo-briefings
seo-reports
market-research
aso-reports
revival-reports

# Session closeouts: objectives, decisions, findings, next actions.
docs

# Not a published page — one stray file, no index.
neurolark

.vercel
